      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im looking into expanding some of our component sourcing for next year. we're weighing up options between looking at suppliers in vietnam vs nigeria. can u give me a breakdown of how the business culture and general reliability of suppliers differs between those two regions? just trying to get a sense of the different risks involved.",
